# Next.js App Router (Resolve)

See [frontend/app/AGENTS.md](../../frontend/app/AGENTS.md).

- Default to Server Components; fetch with `await createClient()` + domain queries.
- No client `useEffect` + `fetch` for initial page data.
- `"use client"` only for hooks, browser APIs, or event handlers.
- Authenticate server actions like API routes (`getUser()` + org resolution).
- Use `Promise.all` for independent server fetches; avoid serial waterfalls.
- After mutations: `revalidatePath` in server actions; `router.refresh()` in client hooks when RSC props must update.
- Auth callback and redirects: `authNextPathSchema.safeParse` from `@/lib/auth/schemas` at each boundary.
- Cron admin all-org mode: `isCronInvocation()` — never when `CRON_SECRET` is unset.
- `export const dynamic = "force-dynamic"` where Supabase data must be fresh.
